# Logs
logs
*.log

# Left behind in existing checkouts by the removed React/Vite front end (#165): still
# ignored so `git add -A` there cannot sweep them in.
node_modules
dist

# Cargo's build output for the workspace (crates/core, crates/model, crates/app)
/target/
*.local

# Agent tooling and local workflow state
.claude/

# CodeGraph's index — a SQLite database, its WAL, a daemon log, pid and socket. Rebuilt
# from the tree on demand and specific to one machine, so indexing stays each developer's
# own choice rather than something a clone inherits.
.codegraph/

# Working notes agents exchange with each other — reviews, findings, hand-offs between
# sessions or between different agents. The directory and its README are tracked so the
# convention survives a clone; everything an agent actually writes stays local. Keeping a
# named home for these stops them landing in the repo root, where `git add -A` sweeps them
# into unrelated commits.
/agent-notes/*
!/agent-notes/README.md

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
